### H9: Faster c3 stroking with c1 negative gives the largest x

WHEN c1 is held at a1 < 0 and c3 is a sine of amplitude 1 at f Hz, THE system SHALL gain forward x from each c3 cycle, so f = 1.5 gives x of 0.3-0.6 m, f = 2 gives x of 0.3-0.7 m, and a1 = -0.5 at f = 1 gives x of 0.15-0.35 m.

